# Resolution: LAST matching rule wins, so specific rules follow general ones.
# U is asserted explicitly for whole subtrees to make E-UPSTREAMWRITE enforceable.
# Governed by AGENTS-licensing.md. Consumed by `build.sh diag run licensing`.

